---
// Illustrative walk-through of one case moving through the workflow.
// All names and page numbers are fictional sample data.
---

<div class="pipeline grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-4" role="img" aria-label="A case file is ingested, agents extract cited facts, a draft report is prepared, and an expert reviews and approves it.">
  <div class="stage rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5" style="--i:0">
    <p class="eyebrow">1 · Case file in</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
      <li class="doc"><span>Medical records</span><span class="shrink-0 text-muted">612 pp</span></li>
      <li class="doc"><span>Deposition</span><span class="shrink-0 text-muted">184 pp</span></li>
      <li class="doc"><span>Employment history</span><span class="shrink-0 text-muted">37 pp</span></li>
      <li class="doc"><span>IME report</span><span class="shrink-0 text-muted">22 pp</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="stage rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5" style="--i:1">
    <p class="eyebrow">2 · AI does the reading</p>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
      <li>
        <p>Lifting restricted to 20 lbs</p>
        <p class="cite">Medical records, p. 118</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>Prior role: warehouse lead, 9 yrs</p>
        <p class="cite">Deposition, p. 42</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>Conflicting RTW date noted</p>
        <p class="cite flag">IME p. 6 vs. records p. 301</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="stage rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5" style="--i:2">
    <p class="eyebrow">3 · Draft prepared</p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-serif text-base">Vocational Evaluation</p>
    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="line w-full"></div>
      <div class="line w-11/12"></div>
      <div class="line w-4/5"></div>
      <div class="line w-full"></div>
      <div class="line w-2/3"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-muted">Every statement linked to its source page.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="stage rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5" style="--i:3">
    <p class="eyebrow">4 · Experts do the reasoning</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm">You review the facts, resolve the flags and apply your professional judgment.</p>
    <div class="mt-5 flex gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="rounded-full bg-brand px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-brand-ink">Approve</span>
      <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold">Edit</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .doc {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.6rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
  }
  .cite {
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .cite::before {
    content: '↳ ';
  }
  .cite.flag {
    color: #b45309;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .cite.flag { color: #fbbf24; }
  }
  .line {
    height: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--line);
  }
  .stage {
    position: relative;
    animation: glow 8s ease-in-out infinite;
    animation-delay: calc(var(--i) * 2s);
  }
  @keyframes glow {
    0%, 30%, 100% { border-color: var(--line); box-shadow: none; }
    8%, 22% {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--accent-soft);
    }
  }
</style>
